axiom bitop_eqs_i (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf r1 r2 r3 r4: expr): $ bitwise_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec $ > $ closed nz f $ > $ closed nz bf $ > $ ty G f (pi nat_ty (pi nat_ty nat_ty)) $ > $ ty G bf (pi B (pi B B)) $ > $ deq G f (app fb bf) (pi nat_ty (pi nat_ty nat_ty)) $ > $ deq G (app (app bf t) t) r1 B $ > $ deq G (app (app bf t) u) r2 B $ > $ deq G (app (app bf u) t) r3 B $ > $ deq G (app (app bf u) u) r4 B $ > $ bitop_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf r1 r2 r3 r4 $;
axiom leqv_refl (a: lvl): $ leqv a a $;
axiom leqv_symm (a b: lvl): $ leqv a b $ > $ leqv b a $;
axiom leqv_trans (a b c: lvl): $ leqv a b $ > $ leqv b c $ > $ leqv a c $;
axiom leqv_succ (a b: lvl): $ leqv a b $ > $ leqv (ls a) (ls b) $;
axiom leqv_max (a b c d: lvl): $ leqv a b $ > $ leqv c d $ > $ leqv (lmax a c) (lmax b d) $;
axiom leqv_imax (a b c d: lvl): $ leqv a b $ > $ leqv c d $ > $ leqv (limax a c) (limax b d) $;
axiom lmax_comm (a b: lvl): $ leqv (lmax a b) (lmax b a) $;
axiom lmax_assoc (a b c: lvl): $ leqv (lmax (lmax a b) c) (lmax a (lmax b c)) $;
axiom lmax_idem (a: lvl): $ leqv (lmax a a) a $;
axiom lmax_zero (a: lvl): $ leqv (lmax lz a) a $;
axiom lmax_succ (a b: lvl): $ leqv (lmax (ls a) (ls b)) (ls (lmax a b)) $;
axiom lmax_succ_self (a: lvl): $ leqv (lmax a (ls a)) (ls a) $;
axiom limax_zero (a: lvl): $ leqv (limax a lz) lz $;
axiom limax_zero_l (a: lvl): $ leqv (limax lz a) a $;
axiom limax_one (a: lvl): $ leqv (limax (ls lz) a) a $;
axiom limax_succ (a b: lvl): $ leqv (limax a (ls b)) (lmax a (ls b)) $;
axiom limax_self (a: lvl): $ leqv (limax a a) a $;
axiom limax_max (a b c: lvl): $ leqv (limax a (lmax b c)) (lmax (limax a b) (limax a c)) $;
axiom limax_imax (a b c: lvl): $ leqv (limax a (limax b c)) (lmax (limax a c) (limax b c)) $;
axiom leqv_cases (n: nat) (l r l0 r0 l1 r1: lvl): $ lsubst n l lz l0 $ > $ lsubst n r lz r0 $ > $ leqv l0 r0 $ > $ lsubst n l (ls (lparam n)) l1 $ > $ lsubst n r (ls (lparam n)) r1 $ > $ leqv l1 r1 $ > $ leqv l r $;
axiom leqv_inst (S: lvls) (l r l2 r2: lvl): $ leqv l r $ > $ linst S l l2 $ > $ linst S r r2 $ > $ leqv l2 r2 $;
axiom bvar (G: ctx) (i: nat) (A: expr): $ lookup G i A $ > $ ty G (bvar i) A $;
axiom symm (G: ctx) (e e2 A: expr): $ deq G e e2 A $ > $ deq G e2 e A $;
axiom trans (G: ctx) (e1 e2 e3 A: expr): $ deq G e1 e2 A $ > $ deq G e2 e3 A $ > $ deq G e1 e3 A $;
axiom sortDF (G: ctx) (l l2: lvl): $ leqv l l2 $ > $ deq G (srt l) (srt l2) (srt (ls l)) $;
axiom appDF (G: ctx) (f f2 A B a a2 R: expr): $ deq G f f2 (pi A B) $ > $ deq G a a2 A $ > $ inst nz B a R $ > $ deq G (app f a) (app f2 a2) R $;
axiom lamDF (G: ctx) (u: lvl) (A A2 b b2 B: expr): $ deq G A A2 (srt u) $ > $ deq (cons A G) b b2 B $ > $ deq G (lam A b) (lam A2 b2) (pi A B) $;
axiom forallEDF (G: ctx) (u v: lvl) (A A2 B B2: expr): $ deq G A A2 (srt u) $ > $ deq (cons A G) B B2 (srt v) $ > $ deq G (pi A B) (pi A2 B2) (srt (limax u v)) $;
axiom defeqDF (G: ctx) (u: lvl) (A B e e2: expr): $ deq G A B (srt u) $ > $ deq G e e2 A $ > $ deq G e e2 B $;
axiom beta (G: ctx) (A e B a r R: expr): $ ty (cons A G) e B $ > $ ty G a A $ > $ inst nz e a r $ > $ inst nz B a R $ > $ deq G (app (lam A e) a) r R $;
axiom eta (G: ctx) (A B e e1: expr): $ ty G e (pi A B) $ > $ lift n1 nz e e1 $ > $ deq G (lam A (app e1 (bvar nz))) e (pi A B) $;
axiom proofIrrel (G: ctx) (p h h2: expr): $ ty G p Prop $ > $ ty G h p $ > $ ty G h2 p $ > $ deq G h h2 p $;
axiom instDF (k: nat) (G0 G1 G: ctx) (A0 a e e2 A r r2 R: expr): $ ty G0 a A0 $ > $ cinst k G0 A0 a G1 G $ > $ deq G1 e e2 A $ > $ inst k e a r $ > $ inst k e2 a r2 $ > $ inst k A a R $ > $ deq G r r2 R $;
axiom weakDF (n: nat) (G G2: ctx) (e e2 A r r2 R: expr): $ deq G e e2 A $ > $ cext n G G2 $ > $ lift n nz e r $ > $ lift n nz e2 r2 $ > $ lift n nz A R $ > $ deq G2 r r2 R $;
axiom eeqv_df (G: ctx) (e e2 A: expr): $ ty G e A $ > $ eeqv e e2 $ > $ deq G e e2 A $;
axiom ind_ty_ty (G: ctx) (D: ind) (b: blk) (P: ctx) (T: tys) (i: nat) (F R: expr) (C: ctors): $ tys_ok G D $ > $ ind_data D b P T $ > $ nth_ty T i F C $ > $ pis P F R $ > $ ty G (ind_ty D i) R $;
axiom ind_ctor_ty (G: ctx) (D: ind) (b: blk) (P N: ctx) (T: tys) (i c np n m: nat) (F K K2 K3 R: expr) (C: ctors): $ ind_wf G D $ > $ ind_data D b P T $ > $ nth_ty T i F C $ > $ nth_ctor C c K $ > $ clen P np $ > $ ntys T n m $ > $ sinst D nz n np K K2 $ > $ ind_nested D N $ > $ rst D N K2 K3 $ > $ pis P K3 R $ > $ ty G (ind_ctor D i c) R $;
axiom ind_rec_ty (G: ctx) (D: ind) (N: ctx) (i: nat) (v: lvl) (R0 R: expr): $ ind_wf G D $ > $ elim_ok G D v $ > $ rec_ty D v i R0 $ > $ ind_nested D N $ > $ rst D N R0 R $ > $ ty G (ind_rec D i v) R $;
axiom ind_iota (G: ctx) (D D2: ind) (N: ctx) (i c: nat) (v: lvl) (np n m a0 a ni k nf nq: nat) (R e3 e4 Y maj rhs0 rhs R0 RT T: expr): $ spine (ind_rec D i v) e4 k $ > $ spine (ind_ctor D2 i c) maj nq $ > $ ind_wf G D $ > $ elim_ok G D v $ > $ rec_rule D v i c R $ > $ ind_arity D np n m $ > $ add np n a0 $ > $ add a0 m a $ > $ nidx D i ni $ > $ add a ni k $ > $ nfields D i c nf $ > $ add np nf nq $ > $ rehead (ind_rec D i v) R a e3 rhs0 $ > $ spine e3 e4 ni $ > $ spine Y maj nf $ > $ rehead Y rhs0 nf maj rhs $ > $ rec_ty D v i R0 $ > $ ind_nested D N $ > $ rst D N R0 RT $ > $ sty G (ind_rec D i v) RT (app e4 maj) T $ > $ deq G (app e4 maj) rhs T $;
axiom ind_iota_nst (G: ctx) (D I I2: ind) (N: ctx) (i ii c: nat) (v: lvl) (np n m a0 a ni k nf nq npi: nat) (R e3 e4 X Y maj rhs0 rhs R0 RT T: expr): $ spine (ind_rec D i v) e4 k $ > $ spine (ind_ctor I2 ii c) maj nq $ > $ ind_wf G D $ > $ elim_ok G D v $ > $ ind_nested D N $ > $ aux_of D N i X $ > $ spine (ind_ty I ii) X npi $ > $ rec_rule D v i c R $ > $ ind_arity D np n m $ > $ add np n a0 $ > $ add a0 m a $ > $ nidx D i ni $ > $ add a ni k $ > $ nfields D i c nf $ > $ add npi nf nq $ > $ rehead (ind_rec D i v) R a e3 rhs0 $ > $ spine e3 e4 ni $ > $ spine Y maj nf $ > $ rehead Y rhs0 nf maj rhs $ > $ rec_ty D v i R0 $ > $ rst D N R0 RT $ > $ sty G (ind_rec D i v) RT (app e4 maj) T $ > $ deq G (app e4 maj) rhs T $;
axiom proj_ty (G: ctx) (D: ind) (b: blk) (P N: ctx) (T: tys) (j i np: nat) (e e2 S A A1 A2 R: expr): $ deq G e e2 S $ > $ spine (ind_ty D j) S np $ > $ ind_wf G D $ > $ ind_data D b P T $ > $ struct_like D j $ > $ proj_ok G D j i $ > $ clen P np $ > $ field_ty D j i A $ > $ ind_nested D N $ > $ rst D N A A2 $ > $ pinst i S A2 A1 $ > $ qinst b e i nz A1 R $ > $ deq G (proj b i e) (proj b i e2) R $;
axiom proj_mk (G: ctx) (D2: ind) (b: blk) (j i np n m nf nq ii: nat) (M Y f T: expr): $ spine (ind_ctor D2 j nz) M nq $ > $ ind_arity D2 np n m $ > $ nfields D2 j nz nf $ > $ add np nf nq $ > $ add ii (s i) nf $ > $ spine (app Y f) M ii $ > $ ty G (proj b i M) T $ > $ deq G (proj b i M) f T $;
axiom ind_eta (G: ctx) (D: ind) (b: blk) (P: ctx) (T: tys) (j np nf: nat) (e S Y M: expr): $ ty G e S $ > $ spine (ind_ty D j) S np $ > $ ind_wf G D $ > $ ind_data D b P T $ > $ eta_ok D j $ > $ clen P np $ > $ rehead (ind_ty D j) (ind_ctor D j nz) np S Y $ > $ nfields D j nz nf $ > $ projs b e nf Y M $ > $ deq G e M S $;
axiom quot_ty (G: ctx) (u: lvl): $ ty G (quot u) (pi (srt u) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) Prop)) (srt u))) $;
axiom quot_mk_ty (G: ctx) (u: lvl): $ ty G (quot_mk u) (pi (srt u) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) Prop)) (pi (bvar n1) (app (app (quot u) (bvar n2)) (bvar n1))))) $;
axiom quot_lift_ty (G: ctx) (u v: lvl): $ ty G (quot_lift u v) (pi (srt u) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) Prop)) (pi (srt v) (pi (pi (bvar n2) (bvar n1)) (pi (pi (bvar n3) (pi (bvar n4) (pi (app (app (bvar n4) (bvar n1)) (bvar nz)) (app (app (app (ind_ty (eq_D v) nz) (bvar n4)) (app (bvar n3) (bvar n2))) (app (bvar n3) (bvar n1)))))) (pi (app (app (quot u) (bvar n4)) (bvar n3)) (bvar n3))))))) $;
axiom quot_ind_ty (G: ctx) (u: lvl): $ ty G (quot_ind u) (pi (srt u) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) Prop)) (pi (pi (app (app (quot u) (bvar n1)) (bvar nz)) Prop) (pi (pi (bvar n2) (app (bvar n1) (app (app (app (quot_mk u) (bvar n3)) (bvar n2)) (bvar nz)))) (pi (app (app (quot u) (bvar n3)) (bvar n2)) (app (bvar n2) (bvar nz))))))) $;
axiom quot_lift_mk (G: ctx) (u v: lvl) (x1 x2 x3 x4 x5: expr) (v1: lvl) (y1 y2 a T: expr): $ sty G (quot_lift u v) (pi (srt u) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) Prop)) (pi (srt v) (pi (pi (bvar n2) (bvar n1)) (pi (pi (bvar n3) (pi (bvar n4) (pi (app (app (bvar n4) (bvar n1)) (bvar nz)) (app (app (app (ind_ty (eq_D v) nz) (bvar n4)) (app (bvar n3) (bvar n2))) (app (bvar n3) (bvar n1)))))) (pi (app (app (quot u) (bvar n4)) (bvar n3)) (bvar n3))))))) (app (app (app (app (app (app (quot_lift u v) x1) x2) x3) x4) x5) (app (app (app (quot_mk v1) y1) y2) a)) T $ > $ deq G (app (app (app (app (app (app (quot_lift u v) x1) x2) x3) x4) x5) (app (app (app (quot_mk v1) y1) y2) a)) (app x4 a) T $;
axiom quot_ind_mk (G: ctx) (u: lvl) (x1 x2 x3 x4: expr) (v1: lvl) (y1 y2 a T: expr): $ sty G (quot_ind u) (pi (srt u) (pi (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) Prop)) (pi (pi (app (app (quot u) (bvar n1)) (bvar nz)) Prop) (pi (pi (bvar n2) (app (bvar n1) (app (app (app (quot_mk u) (bvar n3)) (bvar n2)) (bvar nz)))) (pi (app (app (quot u) (bvar n3)) (bvar n2)) (app (bvar n2) (bvar nz))))))) (app (app (app (app (app (quot_ind u) x1) x2) x3) x4) (app (app (app (quot_mk v1) y1) y2) a)) T $ > $ deq G (app (app (app (app (app (quot_ind u) x1) x2) x3) x4) (app (app (app (quot_mk v1) y1) y2) a)) (app x4 a) T $;
axiom lit_zero (G: ctx): $ deq G (lit b0) (ind_ctor nat_D nz nz) (ind_ty nat_D nz) $;
axiom lit_succ (G: ctx) (a b: bin): $ bsucc a b $ > $ deq G (lit b) (app (ind_ctor nat_D nz n1) (lit a)) (ind_ty nat_D nz) $;
axiom nat_add_lit (G: ctx) (f: expr) (a b c: bin): $ add_eqs G f $ > $ badd a b c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_sub_lit (G: ctx) (f p: expr) (a b c: bin): $ sub_eqs G f p $ > $ badd c b a $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_sub_lit0 (G: ctx) (f p: expr) (a b c: bin): $ sub_eqs G f p $ > $ badd a c b $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit b0) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_mul_lit (G: ctx) (f fa: expr) (a b c: bin): $ mul_eqs G f fa $ > $ bmul a b c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_pow_lit (G: ctx) (f fm fa: expr) (a b c: bin): $ pow_eqs G f fm fa $ > $ bpow a b c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_beq_lit (G: ctx) (f B t u: expr) (a: bin): $ beq_eqs G f B t u $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit a)) t B $;
axiom nat_beq_lit_lt (G: ctx) (f B t u: expr) (a b c: bin): $ beq_eqs G f B t u $ > $ baddc a c b $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) u B $;
axiom nat_beq_lit_gt (G: ctx) (f B t u: expr) (a b c: bin): $ beq_eqs G f B t u $ > $ baddc b c a $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) u B $;
axiom nat_ble_lit (G: ctx) (f B t u: expr) (a b c: bin): $ ble_eqs G f B t u $ > $ badd a c b $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) t B $;
axiom nat_ble_lit_gt (G: ctx) (f B t u: expr) (a b c: bin): $ ble_eqs G f B t u $ > $ baddc b c a $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) u B $;
axiom nat_shl_lit (G: ctx) (f fm fa: expr) (a b p c: bin): $ shl_eqs G f fm fa $ > $ bpow (bd0 (bd1 b0)) b p $ > $ bmul a p c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_shr_lit_z (G: ctx) (f fd: expr) (a: bin): $ shr_eqs G f fd $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b0)) (lit a) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_shr_lit_s (G: ctx) (f fd: expr) (a b b2 c c2: bin): $ shr_eqs G f fd $ > $ bsucc b b2 $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $ > $ deq G (app (app fd (lit c)) (lit (bd0 (bd1 b0)))) (lit c2) nat_ty $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b2)) (lit c2) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_div_lit (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p f go pfs lem: expr) (a b q m r x: bin): $ div_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p f go pfs lem $ > $ bmul q b m $ > $ badd m r a $ > $ baddc r x b $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit q) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_div_lit0 (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p f go pfs lem: expr) (a: bin): $ div_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p f go pfs lem $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) lit0) lit0 nat_ty $;
axiom nat_mod_lit (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite f go pfs lem: expr) (a b q m r x: bin): $ mod_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite f go pfs lem $ > $ bmul q b m $ > $ badd m r a $ > $ baddc r x b $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit r) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_mod_lit0 (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite f go pfs lem: expr) (a: bin): $ mod_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite f go pfs lem $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) lit0) (lit a) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_gcd_lit (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite fm gom pfs lem eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo f pack F pfF: expr) (a b g p2 q x y m n: bin): $ gcd_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite fm gom pfs lem eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo f pack F pfF $ > $ bmul g p2 a $ > $ bmul g q b $ > $ bmul x a m $ > $ bmul y b n $ > $ badd n g m $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit g) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_gcd_lit2 (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite fm gom pfs lem eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo f pack F pfF: expr) (a b g p2 q x y m n: bin): $ gcd_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p ite fm gom pfs lem eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo f pack F pfF $ > $ bmul g p2 a $ > $ bmul g q b $ > $ bmul x a m $ > $ bmul y b n $ > $ badd m g n $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit g) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_land_lit (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf: expr) (a b c: bin): $ bitop_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf t u u u $ > $ band a b c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_lor_lit (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf: expr) (a b c: bin): $ bitop_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf t t t u $ > $ bor a b c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
axiom nat_xor_lit (G: ctx) (B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf: expr) (a b c: bin): $ bitop_eqs G B t u Not Dec dite T R ofT ofF leN dleN ble pf sub p fd god fm gom pfs lem ite eqN deqN beq pq bp bd fa fix go eager al motive hm ltN pfx pfgo fb pack Fb pfB dec f bf u t t u $ > $ bxor a b c $ > $ deq G (app (app f (lit a)) (lit b)) (lit c) nat_ty $;
term inh: ctx > expr > wff;
axiom inh_i (G: ctx) (e A: expr): $ ty G e A $ > $ inh G A $;
